# Lesson 3.2 example: name a list and ask helper questions about it

# A list keeps several values together under one name.
statuses equals list of " approved ", "pending", and "rejected"

# These helpers read from the list without changing it.
Print count of statuses
Print first of statuses
Print trim first of statuses

# Join turns a list into text; split turns text back into a list.
Print join statuses with ", "
Print split "A|B|C" by "|"
